          "Access belongs inside the evidence rule for support to success handoff evidence. A reviewer locked out of the source cannot confirm anything, and a screenshot is weak. Use named accounts with the least rights needed and revoke them at the end. CustomerSuccessManagers logs access failures as findings so the sample does not drift. Keep the note short enough to read during a live account conversation and specific enough to test afterward.",
